  "description": "High-performance io_uring transport for ASP.NET Core Kestrel. Drop-in replacement for the default socket transport. Up to 15% faster than sockets at 1024+ connections on Linux with thread-per-core architecture, zero-alloc send path, and inline HTTP processing.",
  "id": "Kestrel.Transport.IoUring",
